{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdLrwMAAUP7oiS2rChBwj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. The REWORK FINDING is fully addressed and committed as `d4c3833` with the required trailers, on a clean tree.\n\n## What the rework needed\n\nREVIEW-A's MAJOR finding was that `_harness_floor_failures` accepted a **missing/incomplete root `.venv`** whenever ambient Python was ≥3.11, and `harness_python` then silently fell back to ambient `sys.executable` — re-opening the false-green hole WI-286 exists to close (an ambient interpreter can clear the version floor yet lack the pinned `requirements-dev` tools the bar assumes).\n\nSession 003 had already staged the core fix but left it **uncommitted** (`BUILD NO-COMMIT`). I verified it, corrected one stale in-scope comment, ran the harness green, and committed.\n\n## The fix (now in git)\n\n- **`_harness_floor_failures` fails closed on three shapes** and never consults ambient Python: (1) no runnable root `.venv` — absent *or* incomplete/corrupt layout (`venv_python` returns `None`), pointing at `dev-setup --install`; (2) an unrunnable `.venv`; (3) a below-floor `.venv`. It rides the same `dispatch_run` preflight gate (folded with `+`, no new branch).\n- **`harness_python`'s `sys.executable` fallback** is now documented as a defensive default only — unreachable on the dispatcher's real path since preflight fails closed first.\n- **Tests cover the no-`.venv` ≥3.11 flow** the finding asked for: `test_harness_floor_refuses_no_venv_even_when_ambient_is_at_floor` (real resolver, no monkeypatch — the exact hole) and end-to-end `test_dispatcher_refuses_a_venvless_root`, plus `test_harness_floor_refuses_a_missing_venv`. A shared `seed_venv` (conftest) gives every end-to-end dispatch fixture a real ≥3.11 `.venv` so the now-fail-closed preflight passes.\n- **Size ratchet** re-stamped `3614 → 3627` with a reviewed reason; **spec** Done-when + Resolution updated to record the fail-closed behavior.\n\n## Verification (all under the pinned root `.venv`, 3.11.9)\n\n- Targeted WI-286 + ratchet tests: **9 passed**\n- Full unfiltered suite: **1428 passed, 5 skipped in 359.55s** — no failures\n- Pre-commit floor (freshness/integrity/trajectory/privacy): all **PASS**; `ruff format --check`: **106 files already formatted**\n\nOne note for the integrator: the WARNs surfaced (`IF-068` undeclared, the cross-component `gen_trajectory→schedule` seam, the expected \"WI-286 SpecRef changed — re-validate\" touch, and the perceptual-stale critique for SR-052/053/054) are pre-existing and outside this worker's scope — they're your close-ritual / separate items, not regressions from this commit."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1811,"cache_read_input_tokens":115345,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1811},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f5aa2a62-2c8f-42f6-91ae-46b8aac033ce","uuid":"e2a8a972-6cc7-40b2-b045-f4ff21dc163a","request_id":"req_011CdLrwHuhffeVW8q7ASwW3"}
